Do NOT create an isolated "Courses" section.

Courses should be tightly connected to:

- Financial Health
- Income
- Expenses
- Budget
- Loans
- Insurance
- Investments
- SIP
- Financial Goals
- Retirement
- FIRE
- Net Worth
