- Existing Finance Freedom calculators/tools
- AI Financial Advisor

The course system should reuse existing financial data and tools wherever possible.

Avoid asking users to enter the same information multiple times.

---

# 3. USER JOURNEY

A new user should experience:

```text
SIGN UP
   ↓
FINANCIAL HEALTH ASSESSMENT
   ↓
FINANCIAL FREEDOM SCORE
   ↓
RECOMMENDED LEARNING PATH
   ↓
FOUNDATION
   ↓
GROWTH
   ↓
FREEDOM
```

However, users should NOT be forced to complete levels sequentially.

The system should recommend lessons based on financial needs.

Example:

User understands investing but has significant high-interest debt.

Recommended path:

```text
1. Understand Your Debt
2. Debt Repayment Strategy
3. Emergency Fund
4. Insurance
5. Investing
```

Not:

```text
Lesson 1
Lesson 2
Lesson 3
...
```

