# 17. AI FINANCIAL COACH

Integrate the existing Finance Freedom AI advisor.

The AI should be aware of:

- Current lesson
- User financial profile
- Financial Health Score
- User goals
- Existing calculations
- Course progress
- Previous actions

Example:

User asks:

> "Why do I need an emergency fund?"

AI answers using the current lesson context.

User asks:

> "I have ₹2 lakh saved. Is that enough?"

AI should calculate based on the user's actual essential expenses.

It must never invent missing financial information.

If required information is missing:

> "I need your average essential monthly expenses to calculate this."

