# 55. FINAL PRODUCT PRINCIPLE

The most important requirement:

> **Finance Freedom should not teach users about money and then leave them alone.**

Every important lesson should answer:

```text
What did I learn?
        ↓
What does this mean for MY finances?
        ↓
What should I do?
        ↓
Which Finance Freedom tool can help?
        ↓
What action should I take?
        ↓
Did my financial position improve?
```

The ultimate objective is not:

> "Complete the course."

The ultimate objective is:

> **"Become financially stronger."**

The product should therefore optimize for:

```text
Knowledge
   +
Understanding
   +
Action
   +
Financial Improvement
   =
Financial Freedom
```

Build the feature as a core part of the Finance Freedom product, not as an independent LMS.